  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian support to UNHCRs refugee and IDP internally displaced   persons operations in Afghanistan, Chad, Somalia, Kenya, Colombia,    Irak, Syrien and Mali.Tematic support to implementation of UNHCRs     Policy for SGBV Sexual and Gender based Violence, and support to      pilotproject Transistional Solutions Initiative in eastern Sudan and  Colombia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Humanit&#xe4;rt st&#xf6;d till UNHCRs program f&#xf6;r flyktingar och                internflyktingar i Afghanistan, Chad, Somalia, Kenya, Colombia, Irak, Syrien och Mali. Tematiskt st&#xf6;d till implementering av UNHCRs policy  f&#xf6;r Sexuellt och k&#xf6;nsrelaterat v&#xe5;ld samt st&#xf6;d till pilotprojektet     Transistional Solutions Initiative i &#xf6;stra Sudan och Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
